  "en": "The duration comes directly <b>after the verb</b>.<br><span style=\"color:var(--muted)\">我来了两个多月了 / 我每天都练一个小时</span><br>With an object: the verb is repeated or the duration goes between verb and object:<br><span style=\"color:var(--muted)\">我写汉字写了半个小时 / 我看了一个小时电视 / 我学了两年(的)汉语</span>",
  "type": "",
